  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help to cure newborns from jaundice in Kazakhstan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 2007, AYALA charity foundation has covered 36 cities, population centers, and 67 medical facilities in Kazakhstan under the &quot;Breath life&quot; project. &quot;Breath life&quot; is a project on the equipping children ICUs with vitally important equipment for saving newborn baby&apos;s lives.  Under this project, our foundation plans to equip a &quot;Kostanay regional hospital&quot; with 5 phototherapy lamps in order to cure newborns from jaundice and following damages.</narrative>
  </description>
